    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: For public regeneration and regulative-development series, quantify convergence toward a reference organ morphology after perturbation and compare collective correction with local cell-autonomous or passive-mechanical models.";
